{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n杜如風（Helen）在TVB節目《跟風旅行團》再次展示驚人消費力！她日前直搗首爾一間有3層樓高的「平價飾品天堂」，化身「最強購物者」瘋狂掃貨，完全不看價錢，買到購物籃爆滿，最終埋單金額更讓所有人震驚，究竟她以超抵價錢買了多少戰利品？\n</p>\n<h2>杜如風直搗3層飾品天堂 3萬款單品買到手軟</h2>\n<p>在最新一集節目中，杜如風來到被譽為「平價飾品天堂」的購物熱點，該店舖規模驚人，足足有三層樓高，提供包括耳環、髮圈、鞋、手袋等超過30,000種款式的商品，琳瑯滿目，應有盡有。一向熱愛購物的Helen一進店內便雙眼發光，購物慾大爆發，立即化身「最強購物者」，準備在這片飾品海中瘋狂尋寶，誓要將心頭好全部帶回家。</p>\n<h2>化身最強購物者唔睇價錢 杜如風金句連發：「啱晒我！」</h2>\n<p>面對滿坑滿谷的平價飾品，杜如風完全進入「失心瘋」狀態，其購物模式更是霸氣十足，完全不看價錢，只要看上眼就直接放進購物籃。期間她金句連連，不斷高呼：「啱晒我」、「好抵喎」、「似我啲嘢喎」，購物籃在短時間內便迅速被塞滿，戰利品極之豐富，展現出驚人的掃貨實力，讓觀眾隔著螢幕也感受到她的興奮。</p>\n<h2>狂掃個半鐘唔覺攰 杜如風戰利品塞爆手埋單僅千零蚊</h2>\n<p>杜如風在飾品天堂足足逛了1個半小時，但她卻興奮得表示感覺「好似行咗半個鐘」，完全沉醉在購物的樂趣之中。最令人震驚的是，當她拿著塞得滿滿的購物籃和手上大包小包的戰利品去結帳時，最終埋單金額竟然只是千零蚊港幣，超高性價比的結果讓她本人也大感驚喜，完美示範如何在首爾以最抵價錢瘋狂掃貨。</p>\n<h2>網民睇到心心眼：「求地址！下次去首爾要掃貨！」</h2>\n<p>節目播出後，杜如風的超強購物力及驚人的埋單價錢，立即引起網民暴動，紛紛表示極度羨慕。大批網民留言跪求店舖地址：「千零蚊買到成手都係？太誇張！求地址！」、「睇見Helen買得咁爽，我都好想去瘋狂掃貨！」、「30,000款飾品，行一日都行唔晒啦，好想去尋寶！」、「呢啲先係真．旅遊節目，提供實用資訊！」、「杜如風買嘢真係好治癒，完全唔睇價錢好霸氣！」。</p>\n<p>（圖片來源：TVB）</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_13691172006af920e0b2685.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_13691172006af920e0b2685.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_12855911736af920e5928cb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_12855911736af920e5928cb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_17073896196af920eae91c8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_17073896196af920eae91c8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_8448958136af920ef92887.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_8448958136af920ef92887.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/22_3117333606af920f4f2e0d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/22_3117333606af920f4f2e0d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/23_18245403976af9210288ecd.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/23_18245403976af9210288ecd.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/24_7811651836af921115aaa2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/24_7811651836af921115aaa2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/25_10907891836af92118580c9.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/25_10907891836af92118580c9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T13:18:21.485204+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1142,"images":8,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T13:05:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T13:32:03.155316+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T13:11:48.657875+00:00","content_hash":"f26d8e2d6a51d4d98f1067b6b411c27f946fc2ee69612364133301c159b85b80","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}